OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad fights traveller site
OL,4,Aremoval order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved father has said he "won't
OL,7,Fmake it" if his family is forced to
OL,8,Fleave a traveller site which was built
OL,9,Fwithout planning permission on the edge
OL,10,Fof the Yorkshire Dales.
OL,12,FJames and Naomi Miller, who moved onto
OL,13,Fland near Hudswell earlier this year,
OL,14,Fhave laid gravel and concrete on the
OL,15,Fplot and installed a mobile home and
OL,16,Fcaravan.
OL,18,FFollowing an enforcement notice issued
OL,19,Fby North Yorkshire Council, the couple,
OL,20,Fwhose 19-year-old son recently died in
OL,21,Fa crash, appealed to the planning
OL,22,Finspectorate to overturn the order.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
