OL,3,GNEWSABereaved dad fights traveller site
OL,4,Aremoval order
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen asked about the impact of the
OL,7,Fremoval on his health, Miller told a
OL,8,Fplanning hearing: "I won't make it,
OL,9,Fthat's the impact of it."
